  "techniques": [
    "accelerating slam with zoom blur",
    "inhale anticipation",
    "independent shockwave ring(s)",
    "refraction displacement band",
    "volumetric rays through letter gaps",
    "implosion exit"
  ],
  "design": {
    "entrance": "A short inhale (the air darkens and haze is pulled inward), then the title slams down from in front of the camera, accelerating into its mark with zoom blur.",
    "reveal": "Radial impact: a crisp crimson ring, a wide pressure-haze ring and a refraction band travel outward independently of the title; light rays stream from behind the letters.",
    "camera": "Hard zoom kick and short violent shake at the strike, then a slow dominant push-in.",
    "material": "Polished dark chrome with crimson rim and floor reflection tint, hard drop shadow on the haze.",
    "exit": "Implosion: a ring collapses back inward while the title compresses into a point of light."
  },
  "fusion_notes": [
    "The shockwave is fully independent of the title: ShockRingPrimary / ShockRingHaze (expanding EllipseMask rings) and ShockRefraction (Displace driven by RefractRingShape) all key off Impact Frame and scale with Impact Intensity. Move their Center inputs together to relocate the impact point."
  ],
